WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.231
Today we will present performance work as a team. Our work connects with Ghanaian and

00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:06.237
other African artists.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:10.231
Agree on the order of songs, dance or drama items.

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:15.978
Rehearse entry, performance and respectful exit. Record why your chosen technique

00:00:15.978 --> 00:00:17.303
suits the message.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.911
Present the item and thank the audience at the end.
